<title>USA: BellSouth Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>BellSouth Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.70		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net			693,000		  970,000</p>
<p> Oper revs	    4,845,000		4,541,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 992,000		  994,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is BellSouth Corp.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 includes $0.35 a share from after-tax gain on sale of business. The pre-tax gain on the sale was $442 million and the after-tax gain was $344 million.</p>
</text>
